      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Tidal marshes along West River are dominated by Spartina alterniflora, providing nursery habitat for blue crabs and filter‑feeding organisms.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
